Neighborhood Improvement Services
Neighborhood Improvement Services Department
Neighborhood Improvement Services is a community-centered organization that works with residents and across city and county departments to provide the highest quality services to inform, engage and encourage resident civic participation, to ensure safe housing, to quickly respond to public nuisances, and to eliminate discrimination in housing, employment, and places of public accommodation.
